WEBVTT

01:12.900 --> 01:19.019
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.020 --> 01:24.300
[Episode 15]

01:26.656 --> 01:27.656
What's up?

01:28.616 --> 01:29.616
Have a taste.

01:31.376 --> 01:33.896
Yao, don't you introduce her?

01:38.976 --> 01:40.096
She is...

01:40.696 --> 01:41.736
my landlady.

01:42.136 --> 01:43.135
You admit it.

01:43.136 --> 01:44.095
Landlady.

01:44.096 --> 01:45.615
The landlady is really beautiful.

01:45.616 --> 01:46.736
How nice!

01:47.976 --> 01:49.975
Anyway, if I say something else,
you won't believe me.

01:49.976 --> 01:51.295
We will.

01:51.296 --> 01:51.776
I believe it.

01:51.777 --> 01:52.775
Alright, hurry up.

01:52.776 --> 01:53.935
Do your work.

01:53.936 --> 01:54.736
Okay, work.

01:54.736 --> 01:55.736
Come on.

02:05.056 --> 02:06.456
Why did you give up resistance?

02:07.736 --> 02:08.815
People are joking.

02:08.816 --> 02:11.296
The more serious you are,
the more exciting they'll be.

02:11.776 --> 02:12.776
Right.

02:13.496 --> 02:16.816
So, for some things,
just fight fire with fire.

02:17.776 --> 02:18.535
Good point.

02:18.536 --> 02:19.696
Fight fire with fire.

02:22.416 --> 02:23.416
How's it?

02:25.376 --> 02:26.655
It tastes good.

02:26.656 --> 02:27.736
Is it sold in the shop?

02:28.216 --> 02:29.855
A newly established coffee brand.

02:29.856 --> 02:31.015
I thought it tasted good.

02:31.016 --> 02:32.416
And I want to sell it in the store.

02:34.856 --> 02:37.295
Do you think in this Pu'er coffee

02:37.296 --> 02:38.856
there's a taste of Pu'er tea?

02:40.216 --> 02:41.495
Why is there a taste of Pu'er tea?

02:41.496 --> 02:42.776
Isn't Pu'er a place of origin?

02:43.856 --> 02:45.096
You know that.

02:45.496 --> 02:46.655
Many people don't know that

02:46.656 --> 02:48.136
Pu'er is actually the name of a place.

02:48.496 --> 02:50.815
They thought Pu'er just meant that Pu'er tea.

02:50.816 --> 02:53.455
So they think that
Pu'er Coffee is a coffee

02:53.456 --> 02:54.656
which tastes like Pu'er tea.

02:56.496 --> 02:58.496
You turned coffee tasting into an exam.

02:58.736 --> 02:59.496
You're good.

02:59.497 --> 03:01.016
I looked down on you.

03:06.736 --> 03:07.216
Auntie.

03:07.217 --> 03:08.455
I want this one with dinosaurs.

03:08.456 --> 03:09.096
Okay, this?

03:09.097 --> 03:10.575
I want this one with stars.

03:10.576 --> 03:12.375
I also want this one with stars.

03:12.376 --> 03:13.096
Thank you, Auntie.

03:13.096 --> 03:13.736
I want the biggest one.

03:13.737 --> 03:14.935
Look how fun it is.

03:14.936 --> 03:15.376
Here.

03:15.377 --> 03:16.495
Star, isn't it?

03:16.496 --> 03:18.495
Some years later,
you can have another baby.

03:18.496 --> 03:20.296
Bring a girl to the family.

03:25.296 --> 03:26.856
Mom, sit next to me.

03:27.936 --> 03:28.576
Okay.

03:28.577 --> 03:30.495
After Mom divides the cake,
I'll sit next to you.

03:30.496 --> 03:31.776
Okay?

03:32.096 --> 03:33.096
Good.

03:33.416 --> 03:34.416
Have your cake.

03:38.336 --> 03:39.336
Honghong.

03:39.976 --> 03:41.936
Look, it's only a few days,
and she can't leave you.

03:47.096 --> 03:48.095
Yeah.

03:48.096 --> 03:49.376
We just got familiar.

03:50.216 --> 03:51.376
And I'm leaving again.

03:54.376 --> 03:55.335
All right.

03:55.336 --> 03:56.336
It's all right.

03:56.656 --> 03:57.592
Hurry up.

03:57.616 --> 03:59.215
Let me have a piece of cake.

03:59.216 --> 03:59.695
Right.

03:59.696 --> 04:00.696
Here.

04:01.056 --> 04:02.216
Have some cake, Mom.

04:13.496 --> 04:16.055
Is this delicious or that one?

04:16.056 --> 04:17.936
Can these two be fried together?

04:18.656 --> 04:19.776
Mom.

04:20.216 --> 04:21.152
Mom.

04:21.176 --> 04:22.176
He's calling you.

04:22.376 --> 04:23.376
Aunt.

04:24.696 --> 04:27.175
Don't you come back tomorrow?

04:27.176 --> 04:28.375
Chang's family is collecting potatoes.

04:28.376 --> 04:30.096
I come back one day
early to give him a hand.

04:30.376 --> 04:32.375
Then come back early after you finish.

04:32.376 --> 04:33.376
Got it.

04:34.816 --> 04:35.815
Go back early.

04:35.816 --> 04:36.816
Drive carefully.

04:38.496 --> 04:39.935
He came back early.

04:39.936 --> 04:41.376
He must miss you.

04:49.896 --> 04:51.495
You got so muddy.

04:51.496 --> 04:53.495
Why did you wear sneakers to go to the fields?

04:53.496 --> 04:54.656
I didn't want to change them.

04:55.536 --> 04:56.375
Why don't you take a bath?

04:56.376 --> 04:57.495
I'll get your clothes.

04:57.496 --> 04:58.496
No need.

04:59.216 --> 05:00.216
Just wash my feet.

05:00.616 --> 05:01.656
I have to go back later.

05:01.896 --> 05:02.896
Alright.

05:15.656 --> 05:17.335
You've been to Kunming.

05:17.336 --> 05:18.615
Just for collecting potatoes in the hometown,

05:18.616 --> 05:19.655
you came back to help.

05:19.656 --> 05:20.936
Is your business that free?

05:21.336 --> 05:22.336
Your aunt

05:22.616 --> 05:24.775
is doing live flower selling now.

05:24.776 --> 05:26.216
She hired two people to pack.

05:27.096 --> 05:28.655
It's okay for me to
leave for one day.

05:28.656 --> 05:29.656
It's nothing.

05:29.976 --> 05:30.976
Alright.

05:33.776 --> 05:34.776
Enough.

05:35.616 --> 05:36.056
Okay.

05:36.056 --> 05:36.616
Enough?

05:36.616 --> 05:36.896
Sure.

05:36.897 --> 05:38.215
Then I'll put it here. Add it yourself.

05:38.216 --> 05:39.216
Okay.

05:45.616 --> 05:46.896
How's your business?

05:47.536 --> 05:48.576
Not bad.

05:49.416 --> 05:50.576
Not bad.

05:51.376 --> 05:53.656
Be careful unable to repay the loan.

05:53.976 --> 05:55.215
You inquire about this.

05:55.216 --> 05:56.456
Do you want to lend me money?

05:57.376 --> 05:58.615
You made a hole yourself.

05:58.616 --> 06:00.136
I can't fill it in for you.

06:01.816 --> 06:02.816
I heard about it.

06:04.056 --> 06:05.816
The homestay in the village has been shut down.

06:06.416 --> 06:08.496
The construction team made trouble for you.

06:10.856 --> 06:14.016
Quan from Mr. Pipe's
family is just a fool.

06:14.416 --> 06:15.456
All he could do was fight.

06:16.056 --> 06:17.136
No trouble.

06:17.536 --> 06:18.855
I owe them the wages.

06:18.856 --> 06:20.096
Surely they asked for it.

06:21.176 --> 06:25.336
Look at all the mess you've made.

06:25.736 --> 06:26.736
Well,

06:27.056 --> 06:29.175
How nice was your previous work in Beijing!

06:29.176 --> 06:30.336
Well-paid.

06:31.736 --> 06:35.376
If you buy a house over there in the future
and get married,

06:35.656 --> 06:37.936
the child's educational
environment would be top-level.

06:38.176 --> 06:39.175
Tsinghua or Peking University

06:39.176 --> 06:40.576
would all be at your fingertips.

06:41.216 --> 06:43.576
About this,
you'd better count on Yuan.

06:44.656 --> 06:46.456
How about him after he went back?

06:46.976 --> 06:48.096
Well,

06:48.936 --> 06:49.936
this time,

06:50.176 --> 06:51.696
he came back and made some improvements.

06:52.096 --> 06:53.816
When he got back,
he's willing to learn.

07:01.416 --> 07:02.776
I also heard that

07:04.416 --> 07:05.896
you have a date.

07:06.736 --> 07:08.136
Who told you this?

07:09.056 --> 07:11.696
When collecting potatoes,
the villagers told me.

07:12.976 --> 07:14.896
They said she was from Beijing.

07:16.416 --> 07:18.456
Have you dated someone in Beijing?

07:18.736 --> 07:20.295
Don't listen to the villager's nonsense.

07:20.296 --> 07:22.175
The girl's from Beijing,
a tenant of the Yard.

07:22.176 --> 07:23.336
Not my date.

07:24.216 --> 07:25.336
Living in the Yard?

07:25.936 --> 07:27.136
It's very close.

07:28.616 --> 07:30.016
Take her back to meet us.

07:30.976 --> 07:32.535
You don't believe me.

07:32.536 --> 07:33.855
And you believe the outsiders.

07:33.856 --> 07:36.855
They said that you two
walk together every day.

07:36.856 --> 07:37.936
Always together.

07:38.736 --> 07:40.815
She's volunteering for me.

07:40.816 --> 07:42.336
We are in a working relationship.

07:44.976 --> 07:46.016
I knew it.

07:49.376 --> 07:50.495
How could a girl from Beijing

07:50.496 --> 07:52.935
be so weird to follow you to the village

07:52.936 --> 07:54.016
to live a poor life?

07:55.496 --> 07:59.336
In Beijing,
she can marry someone with a house.

07:59.736 --> 08:00.855
The child's educational environment...

08:00.856 --> 08:02.495
The educational environment would be top-level.

08:02.496 --> 08:04.136
Tsinghua or Peking University
is at our fingertips.

08:05.176 --> 08:06.655
I don't know
if Tsinghua and Peking University can hold

08:06.656 --> 08:07.656
so many people.

08:09.096 --> 08:10.096
Come back.

08:11.216 --> 08:14.696
The things your aunt is going
to offer are all in the trunk.

08:14.976 --> 08:15.855
It's in the parking lot.

08:15.856 --> 08:16.856
Bring it back.

08:24.416 --> 08:25.936
Weirdo.

08:28.936 --> 08:29.736
Mom.

08:29.737 --> 08:31.256
Is the meal ready?

08:32.056 --> 08:33.056
Soon.

08:43.656 --> 08:45.336
So many things.

08:53.496 --> 08:54.496
Coming.

08:55.176 --> 08:57.456
Dinner time.

08:59.096 --> 09:00.415
My cooking is a little rough

09:00.416 --> 09:02.375
I just cooked with whatever we had.

09:02.376 --> 09:03.576
Damai, don't mind it.

09:03.816 --> 09:04.936
How come?

09:05.736 --> 09:06.615
How about it? Smell.

09:06.616 --> 09:08.535
It smells good.

09:08.536 --> 09:09.535
Eat more.

09:09.536 --> 09:10.536
Let's eat.

09:16.296 --> 09:17.296
Yummy.

09:18.416 --> 09:19.416
Yummy.

09:19.616 --> 09:19.936
Right?

09:19.937 --> 09:21.776
Xiaochun's cooking
is always delicious.

09:22.856 --> 09:24.415
Let me interview you.

09:24.416 --> 09:27.376
Is it me who cooks
better or my elder brother?

09:29.376 --> 09:30.456
You both have your own advantages.

09:30.856 --> 09:32.735
I found out that your cooking

09:32.736 --> 09:34.696
is just like your own personality.

09:35.616 --> 09:36.816
For Mr. Xie,

09:37.176 --> 09:39.016
his cooking is full of variety.

09:39.296 --> 09:41.816
You don't even know
how he comes up with those matches.

09:42.096 --> 09:43.496
But it's delicious.

09:44.736 --> 09:46.816
For Xiaochun,
it's just simple and direct.

09:47.976 --> 09:48.855
She fried meat with pepper...

09:48.856 --> 09:50.175
All kinds of fried meat with pepper.

09:50.176 --> 09:52.136
And she fried all vegetables with pepper, too.

09:52.536 --> 09:54.816
When you are in a good mood,
you'd add more sour papaya.

09:55.736 --> 09:57.216
There's sour papaya in it.

09:58.016 --> 09:59.016
For Damai,

09:59.296 --> 10:00.536
it's very single-minded.

10:01.176 --> 10:02.415
She only likes making rice noodles.

10:02.416 --> 10:03.655
Dried rice noodles.

10:03.656 --> 10:05.536
Boiled rice noodles and stir fry rice noodles.

10:06.456 --> 10:07.456
And Nana.

10:08.656 --> 10:10.096
Nana likes making desserts.

10:10.776 --> 10:12.175
Baking cakes.

10:12.176 --> 10:13.416
Sweet and beautiful.

10:13.936 --> 10:16.696
But when it comes to cooking,
it's not her area.

10:17.296 --> 10:19.175
The analysis is logical.

10:19.176 --> 10:20.176
Well,

10:20.816 --> 10:22.455
tell us your style.

10:22.456 --> 10:23.176
Mine?

10:23.177 --> 10:24.535
Mine is unpopular.

10:24.536 --> 10:26.416
I can make salted eggs.

10:26.776 --> 10:28.536
I can make the pickled radish.

10:28.816 --> 10:31.575
I can also brew soy sauce
and make soybean paste.

10:31.576 --> 10:32.936
I learned them from my grandma.

10:33.536 --> 10:34.935
It's not unpopular.

10:34.936 --> 10:36.295
It's unusual.

10:36.296 --> 10:37.415
They're not dishes.

10:37.416 --> 10:38.936
They're ingredients.

10:39.656 --> 10:41.416
What's your specialty?

10:43.776 --> 10:45.096
I can make a Crispy Pot.

10:45.656 --> 10:46.656
Crispy Pot?

10:46.936 --> 10:48.216
What is the Crispy Pot?

10:48.896 --> 10:50.535
Every family has different recipes.

10:50.536 --> 10:53.576
In my family,
we have a casserole,

10:54.136 --> 10:55.936
in which we put the pork leg at the bottom,

10:56.176 --> 11:00.216
then add cabbage and
kelp and all the fried food.

11:00.936 --> 11:02.935
Press it and add water.

11:02.936 --> 11:04.175
Then add spices.

11:04.176 --> 11:05.176
Stew it.

11:17.416 --> 11:18.416
Brother.

11:21.656 --> 11:23.536
Uncle brought back so many flowers.

11:24.056 --> 11:25.216
Take some back later.

11:26.056 --> 11:27.056
Where's Uncle?

11:27.296 --> 11:28.175
In the room.

11:28.176 --> 11:29.816
He's chatting with Granny. Go ahead.

11:30.896 --> 11:32.175
Hi, Xiaochun.

11:32.176 --> 11:32.936
Uncle.

11:32.937 --> 11:34.096
Come in.

11:34.416 --> 11:36.175
I haven't seen you for a long time.

11:36.176 --> 11:36.656
Yeah.

11:36.656 --> 11:37.415
Come in.

11:37.416 --> 11:38.416
Granny.

11:41.056 --> 11:42.336
So many flowers.

11:42.936 --> 11:44.296
Which ones are for me?

11:44.936 --> 11:47.775
Except for these chrysanthemums,
pick whichever you like.

11:47.776 --> 11:48.455
Help yourself.

11:48.456 --> 11:50.696
Take back some for Damai and Nana, too.

11:53.296 --> 11:56.816
Your father is truly
a wholesaler in the flower market.

11:58.816 --> 11:59.816
Sweet.

12:00.176 --> 12:01.456
Do you usually buy flowers for yourself?

12:01.776 --> 12:03.175
I don't have time to buy flowers.

12:03.176 --> 12:04.416
I'm not Xu Hongmi.

12:04.776 --> 12:05.935
She got helpers to change the water.

12:05.936 --> 12:06.936
Right?

12:11.416 --> 12:12.295
Your grandpa's day of remembrance.

12:12.296 --> 12:13.336
What are you going to do?

12:13.936 --> 12:15.935
Just sweep the grave.

12:15.936 --> 12:17.575
Offer some flowers and fruits.

12:17.576 --> 12:18.576
Light incense sticks.

12:19.536 --> 12:21.056
In a twinkling,

12:21.416 --> 12:22.696
grandpa has been away for four years.

12:23.056 --> 12:24.895
It's really a blink.

12:24.896 --> 12:26.576
My grandma has been away for three years.

12:28.416 --> 12:30.896
How did your grandma pass away?

12:32.016 --> 12:33.536
She was actually in good health.

12:35.056 --> 12:36.096
It snowed in winter.

12:36.936 --> 12:38.055
The next morning,

12:38.056 --> 12:39.576
there was ice on the floor at the entrance.

12:39.936 --> 12:41.536
She didn't see it and slipped.

12:43.136 --> 12:44.216
Pelvic fracture.

12:45.656 --> 12:47.336
She lay in bed for a week.

12:48.056 --> 12:49.336
Later, it caused thrombosis.

12:51.896 --> 12:52.896
An accident.

13:02.016 --> 13:03.016
What about your grandfather?

13:04.936 --> 13:05.936
Cancer.

13:18.176 --> 13:19.936
You and your grandfather were intimate, right?

13:25.896 --> 13:26.976
In my memory,

13:27.816 --> 13:30.696
there's little about my Dad and my Mom.

13:31.656 --> 13:33.456
It's mostly about Granny and Grandpa.

13:35.296 --> 13:37.455
In the past two years,
when I'm alone,

13:37.456 --> 13:40.696
I often thought about my childhood.

13:41.816 --> 13:42.816
At that time,

13:43.176 --> 13:44.576
Grandpa was very strong.

13:45.416 --> 13:46.456
And he taught me to ride.

14:07.336 --> 14:08.336
Don't run away.

14:08.456 --> 14:09.616
I won't hit you anymore.

14:09.936 --> 14:11.816
Don't run.

14:12.056 --> 14:12.815
Come here.

14:12.816 --> 14:13.816
I won't hit you anymore.

14:14.416 --> 14:16.295
Champion Qiang, run quickly.

14:16.296 --> 14:17.175
Xie Zhiyao.

14:17.176 --> 14:19.135
Xie Qiang will never
leave my brother behind.

14:19.136 --> 14:20.336
Yeah, me too.

14:22.136 --> 14:22.816
Grandpa.

14:22.817 --> 14:23.895
Slow down. Don't run.

14:23.896 --> 14:24.936
Grandpa, help me.

14:25.936 --> 14:26.416
Grandpa.

14:26.417 --> 14:27.815
Granny is going to kill Yao.

14:27.816 --> 14:28.816
What's up?

14:28.936 --> 14:30.936
Did you three do something bad?

14:32.296 --> 14:33.296
What's up?

14:33.936 --> 14:35.856
Deqing came to tell me

14:36.136 --> 14:40.055
that your good Yao put the
firecrackers in their rice bowl.

14:40.056 --> 14:41.135
It's Mr. Peacock who talked first.

14:41.136 --> 14:42.175
We just got even with him.

14:42.176 --> 14:44.295
Mr. Peacock said that
Yao's father and mother

14:44.296 --> 14:45.295
went out to work.

14:45.296 --> 14:46.695
They'll have another baby in the future

14:46.696 --> 14:47.815
and just leave him alone.

14:47.816 --> 14:48.815
That's nonsense.

14:48.816 --> 14:50.456
I'll let your Grandpa
Yang give him a lesson.

14:50.936 --> 14:51.752
Well,

14:51.776 --> 14:54.335
then you shouldn't put the
firecrackers in their rice bowl.

14:54.336 --> 14:55.255
Don't stop me today.

14:55.256 --> 14:56.815
I have to beat him today.

14:56.816 --> 14:58.055
You dare to spoil food again!

14:58.056 --> 14:59.056
Dear.

14:59.176 --> 15:00.055
Calm down.

15:00.056 --> 15:01.456
Calm down.

15:02.656 --> 15:04.295
If you want to hit someone, hit me.

15:04.296 --> 15:06.096
You always spoil him.

15:10.056 --> 15:11.456
One kilo.

15:12.136 --> 15:12.935
Two yuan and twenty cents?

15:12.936 --> 15:13.136
Right.

15:13.136 --> 15:13.416
Right?

15:13.416 --> 15:13.656
Two yuan and twenty cents.

15:13.656 --> 15:14.295
Okay.

15:14.296 --> 15:15.815
Come again if it tastes good.

15:15.816 --> 15:16.695
Okay.

15:16.696 --> 15:19.135
Your kid is clever.

15:19.136 --> 15:20.175
Clever?

15:20.176 --> 15:21.336
Just a naughty boy.

15:21.936 --> 15:22.815
Bye.

15:22.816 --> 15:23.296
Be careful.

15:23.296 --> 15:24.296
Alright.

15:28.176 --> 15:29.295
There aren't many fishes left.

15:29.296 --> 15:30.415
Let's stop selling.

15:30.416 --> 15:32.295
Ask you Granny to stew fish soup for us.

15:32.296 --> 15:33.296
Yeah.

15:35.176 --> 15:36.296
Do you want to eat steamed buns?

15:39.136 --> 15:40.136
Here.

15:40.816 --> 15:42.576
Grandpa, wait for me.

15:44.296 --> 15:45.296
Don't rush.

15:50.296 --> 15:51.255
Grandpa.

15:51.256 --> 15:52.456
Have one.

15:52.896 --> 15:53.655
I'm not hungry.

15:53.656 --> 15:54.656
You have it.

15:56.056 --> 15:57.056
Grandpa.

15:57.336 --> 15:59.015
When I earn money in the future,

15:59.016 --> 16:00.655
I'll buy you steamed buns, too.

16:00.656 --> 16:01.696
That's good.

16:01.936 --> 16:03.296
You should work hard.

16:03.536 --> 16:05.976
In the future,
find a good job to earn money.

16:06.656 --> 16:09.736
At that time,
Grandpa won't fish anymore.

16:10.536 --> 16:12.696
I'll wait for Yao at home

16:13.056 --> 16:14.295
to buy steamed buns for me.

16:14.296 --> 16:15.015
Okay.

16:15.016 --> 16:16.135
And Granny.

16:16.136 --> 16:17.216
Auntie Huailan.

16:17.656 --> 16:19.816
What about your parents?

16:22.296 --> 16:23.296
What?

16:23.656 --> 16:25.096
I won't give them.

16:25.416 --> 16:26.736
Why don't you give it to them?

16:27.936 --> 16:30.135
They didn't come back to see me.

16:30.136 --> 16:31.856
Did they really abandon me?

16:33.656 --> 16:35.216
You stupid grandson.

16:35.536 --> 16:36.856
How could they abandon you?

16:37.576 --> 16:39.655
They work hard to make money outside.

16:39.656 --> 16:40.936
It's all for you.

16:41.656 --> 16:43.176
How hard it is to work!

16:47.416 --> 16:49.096
When will they come back?

16:49.936 --> 16:51.216
They'll come back at the Main Festival.

16:52.416 --> 16:53.616
Do you miss them?

16:55.536 --> 16:56.536
No.

16:57.296 --> 16:58.456
You're lying.

16:59.296 --> 17:00.535
I just don't.

17:00.536 --> 17:03.216
No!

17:03.536 --> 17:04.536
Sit tight.

17:04.896 --> 17:07.336
Let's go home.

17:07.816 --> 17:10.575
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

17:10.576 --> 17:13.455
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

17:13.456 --> 17:17.976
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

17:18.416 --> 17:20.856
Childhood memories are always happy,
right?

17:24.056 --> 17:25.576
Then I went to college.

17:26.136 --> 17:29.055
Every time I called home,
Grandpa and Granny told me that

17:29.056 --> 17:30.335
everything was good at home.

17:30.336 --> 17:31.576
Just study hard.

17:32.536 --> 17:34.816
After graduation,
I got a good job.

17:35.536 --> 17:36.815
Grandpa was very proud.

17:36.816 --> 17:39.976
He talked to everyone
that his Yao is promising.

17:40.336 --> 17:42.216
Granny was not as
showy as he was.

17:50.576 --> 17:52.176
The cancer was such a big thing.

17:54.416 --> 17:55.576
When it was confirmed at that time,

17:57.296 --> 17:59.416
he discussed with the family
and chose not to tell me.

17:59.936 --> 18:01.216
He's afraid of affecting my work.

18:02.536 --> 18:03.895
And then he went to Kunming

18:03.896 --> 18:05.736
to have surgery and chemotherapy.

18:06.176 --> 18:07.176
It took more than half a year.

18:09.696 --> 18:11.575
I was really busy.

18:11.576 --> 18:13.216
I didn't find anything wrong.

18:15.296 --> 18:17.616
When my dad told me that,

18:19.296 --> 18:20.816
he was already lying on the hospital bed.

18:22.056 --> 18:23.336
He couldn't even speak.

18:26.816 --> 18:28.096
That's a pity.

18:31.456 --> 18:32.816
Yeah.

18:33.536 --> 18:35.376
It was really unacceptable at the time.

18:36.336 --> 18:37.776
If they had told me earlier,

18:38.296 --> 18:40.336
at least I could have accompanied
my grandfather for a while.

18:42.816 --> 18:44.176
All these years,

18:45.976 --> 18:47.256
my heart has been...

18:55.856 --> 18:57.016
How to put it?

18:58.536 --> 18:59.816
It's...

19:03.256 --> 19:04.256
You can't get through it.

19:05.776 --> 19:06.776
Yes.

19:08.016 --> 19:09.016
I can't get through it.

19:15.536 --> 19:17.496
I can fully understand this feeling.

19:17.856 --> 19:19.536
When my grandma died,

19:19.856 --> 19:21.576
I didn't think I can get through it.

19:23.136 --> 19:25.375
At that time,
it's better when I worked during the day.

19:25.376 --> 19:27.336
Too busy to think over.

19:28.536 --> 19:29.856
It was hard at night.

19:32.096 --> 19:34.015
Lying in bed,
tossing and turning,

19:34.016 --> 19:35.056
lost in various conjectures.

19:35.976 --> 19:37.136
I always regretted that

19:37.536 --> 19:40.096
I didn't call or accompany her more.

19:40.736 --> 19:42.295
Greet more, meet more.

19:42.296 --> 19:43.296
All these things...

19:47.096 --> 19:48.096
What can we do?

19:49.456 --> 19:51.336
At that time, my best friend

19:51.576 --> 19:53.176
crossed two zones every day

19:53.496 --> 19:54.536
to accompany me.

19:55.816 --> 19:57.336
She took my hand to sleep.

19:58.216 --> 19:59.256
Then I could sleep.

20:01.816 --> 20:03.176
You could go through it with her company.

20:06.096 --> 20:07.736
No, I couldn't at that time.

20:09.856 --> 20:11.096
But it will pass someday.

20:13.536 --> 20:15.496
Then what if I can't get
it through my whole life?

20:20.696 --> 20:21.816
It will pass.

20:22.496 --> 20:24.095
What wouldn't pass in life?

20:24.096 --> 20:25.096
Right?

20:25.336 --> 20:26.976
Those that can't pass will finally pass.

20:27.696 --> 20:28.696
You're right.

20:29.056 --> 20:31.535
But, we all know the logic.

20:31.536 --> 20:32.536
However...

20:34.456 --> 20:36.056
We can't get through when it comes.

20:44.296 --> 20:45.375
What kind of flowers are they?

20:45.376 --> 20:46.656
It smells good.

20:47.256 --> 20:48.256
Lychee.

20:49.056 --> 20:50.056
Lychee.

20:53.256 --> 20:54.576
No smell of lychee.

20:55.136 --> 20:58.335
In Pu'er Coffee,
there's no taste of Pu'er tea.

20:58.336 --> 21:01.136
But lychee rose
does smell like lychee.

21:06.136 --> 21:08.416
You can just donate your nose.

21:28.536 --> 21:31.816
[Today's Thorn Remover, Xie Zhiyao]

23:06.736 --> 23:09.056
The family is all good.

23:09.336 --> 23:10.576
Don't worry.

23:11.496 --> 23:15.095
Just bless the younger generations.

23:15.096 --> 23:17.776
May everything goes smoothly for them.

23:19.016 --> 23:23.735
Yuan stopped reading some time ago.

23:23.736 --> 23:25.176
He wanted to return to his hometown.

23:25.776 --> 23:27.336
You knew that.

23:27.816 --> 23:29.776
He's a bit silly.

23:30.696 --> 23:32.016
Naughty.

23:32.736 --> 23:35.736
He annoyed Yao.

23:36.016 --> 23:37.016
Mom.

23:37.536 --> 23:38.855
He's lying here.

23:38.856 --> 23:40.496
You still keep talking all the time.
[Die at the age of 78]

23:41.056 --> 23:43.016
Can't you leave him free?
[Xie Muqing]

23:43.456 --> 23:47.055
You can't lie here without working.

23:47.056 --> 23:49.976
Otherwise,
why do we offer him and light incense?

23:55.056 --> 23:56.056
Finish cutting?

23:57.016 --> 23:59.056
Around my mother's side,
why is there so much grass?

23:59.296 --> 24:00.336
Taller than me.

24:00.616 --> 24:02.055
Grave grass grows high.

24:02.056 --> 24:03.336
It means that the family is prosperous.

24:04.616 --> 24:08.496
Put these tributes and
candles on your mom's grave.

24:09.856 --> 24:10.856
I'll go.

24:10.976 --> 24:14.016
Later,
cut the grass around your uncle's grave.

24:15.296 --> 24:16.296
My waist,

24:16.536 --> 24:17.536
it hurts again.

24:18.296 --> 24:20.695
You got injuries by collecting potatoes.

24:20.696 --> 24:21.735
Or let me go.

24:21.736 --> 24:22.736
Don't worry.

24:25.816 --> 24:28.775
Why can't I strike the lighter?

24:28.776 --> 24:29.776
Come on, let me see.

24:32.496 --> 24:33.455
There it is.

24:33.456 --> 24:34.535
Look.

24:34.536 --> 24:36.535
Isn't your grandfather tricking me?

24:36.536 --> 24:37.735
He saw you come.

24:37.736 --> 24:38.856
And he left me aside.

24:41.096 --> 24:42.975
You just can't use a lighter.

24:42.976 --> 24:44.496
Who said I can't?

24:45.576 --> 24:47.336
Get down on your knees and kowtow.

24:49.296 --> 24:50.296
You.

24:50.816 --> 24:53.816
Bless our Yao.

24:54.896 --> 24:58.856
May everything he thinks can be achieved.

25:00.216 --> 25:03.295
Find a good girl to have a companion.

25:03.296 --> 25:05.496
So he doesn't have to be alone.

25:06.816 --> 25:09.295
Grandpa,
please take care and bless me more.

25:09.296 --> 25:10.296
Thank you.

25:14.336 --> 25:16.975
Your father seems
to have no lighter.

25:16.976 --> 25:18.135
Give it to him.

25:18.136 --> 25:19.136
Okay.

25:37.576 --> 25:42.456
[[Die at the age of 78, Xie Muqing's grave]

26:03.216 --> 26:04.576
You have a lighter.

26:05.536 --> 26:06.536
Yao.

26:07.496 --> 26:09.256
Come and sit with Dad.

26:17.216 --> 26:22.096
[Beloved wife, Li Yinhuan]

26:25.496 --> 26:26.496
What are you looking at?

26:27.016 --> 26:28.376
The house.

26:31.096 --> 26:33.816
This place beside your
mother is reserved for me.

26:36.056 --> 26:37.856
If you're buried with my mom,

26:38.096 --> 26:39.296
what about Aunt?

26:40.536 --> 26:41.576
Your Aunt said that

26:41.816 --> 26:44.496
in the future,
she will be buried beside her Grandparents.

26:46.816 --> 26:49.376
Then it would be hard for you to meet.

26:49.696 --> 26:51.896
How can we meet after death?

26:52.216 --> 26:54.016
Dead is dead.

26:56.456 --> 26:57.815
Look at your Granny.

26:57.816 --> 26:59.096
She's verbose and superstitious.

27:00.136 --> 27:01.735
She can't use a lighter.

27:01.736 --> 27:03.055
The last time I accompanied her here,

27:03.056 --> 27:04.455
she couldn't light candles.

27:04.456 --> 27:05.776
She insisted that

27:06.056 --> 27:08.736
your grandfather blamed
her for not visiting him often.

27:11.296 --> 27:12.576
She couldn't light it just now.

27:26.376 --> 27:27.616
More than 20 years.

27:34.816 --> 27:36.536
Waking up early this morning,

27:37.376 --> 27:40.255
I was lying in the side room
and looking at that window.

27:40.256 --> 27:41.496
Dazzled.

27:42.296 --> 27:43.536
I felt that

27:44.216 --> 27:45.216
you're young.

27:46.576 --> 27:49.136
When your mother and I came
back from Kunming to see you,

27:49.616 --> 27:51.136
we lived in that house.

27:54.296 --> 27:55.776
The family was poor when you were young.

27:57.056 --> 27:59.096
The family depended on a few land.

27:59.536 --> 28:00.576
Also,

28:02.016 --> 28:03.736
your grandpa went fishing and sell it.

28:04.736 --> 28:08.256
I'm not as good as your mom, who's clever

28:09.136 --> 28:10.256
and had many ideas.

28:10.776 --> 28:13.576
Family affairs was
all your mom's call.

28:14.816 --> 28:16.096
Your mother said that

28:16.896 --> 28:19.535
Yao needed to study well in the future.

28:19.536 --> 28:21.416
There are many places to use money.

28:21.816 --> 28:23.376
We have to get the money.

28:24.576 --> 28:26.056
She went out to inquire.

28:26.496 --> 28:29.096
And she took me to Kunming.

28:31.016 --> 28:33.735
At that time,
the traffic was inconvenient.

28:33.736 --> 28:34.816
There's no transportation.

28:36.536 --> 28:38.295
When arrived in Xiaguan,

28:38.296 --> 28:40.255
We had to walk
more than three hours of mountain road.

28:40.256 --> 28:41.336
To get home.

28:42.816 --> 28:45.376
We came back once a year.

28:46.616 --> 28:47.815
Hurried.

28:47.816 --> 28:48.896
And we couldn't stay for many days.

28:49.776 --> 28:52.416
We haven't got familiar with
you before we have to go back.

28:53.456 --> 28:54.976
Every time we got back,

28:55.256 --> 28:56.816
your mother would cry all the way.

29:02.296 --> 29:03.815
Then she got sick.

29:03.816 --> 29:05.096
Lying in bed,

29:05.776 --> 29:06.816
she couldn't move.

29:07.816 --> 29:09.136
She had no strength to talk.

29:10.976 --> 29:12.096
I asked her.

29:14.696 --> 29:16.136
Do you regret coming out?

29:18.296 --> 29:19.296
She shook her head.

29:22.056 --> 29:23.496
She still shook her head.

29:26.616 --> 29:33.055
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

29:33.056 --> 29:38.775
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

29:38.776 --> 29:41.215
[Li Yinhuan's grave]

29:41.216 --> 29:43.255
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

29:43.256 --> 29:47.815
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

29:47.816 --> 29:48.816
Forget it.

29:50.536 --> 29:51.896
Forget it.

29:53.096 --> 29:55.455
Your Granny must finish nagging.

29:55.456 --> 29:56.056
I'll take a look.

29:56.057 --> 30:02.296
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

30:02.536 --> 30:09.456
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

30:10.736 --> 30:12.695
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

30:12.696 --> 30:17.295
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

30:17.296 --> 30:24.296
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

30:24.656 --> 30:31.616
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

30:43.216 --> 30:44.536
Clean your mouth first.

30:49.896 --> 30:52.135
Besides pure tea,

30:52.136 --> 30:55.015
we considered the needs of different tastes,

30:55.016 --> 30:57.775
and developed a series
of featured products.

30:57.776 --> 30:58.592
Of course,

30:58.616 --> 31:02.615
no matter which product,
our control over raw materials

31:02.616 --> 31:04.215
is very strict.

31:04.216 --> 31:06.256
Absolutely zero pollution,

31:06.576 --> 31:07.576
purely natural.

31:18.576 --> 31:19.576
Mixed tea.

31:27.096 --> 31:28.656
The most important is this one.

31:40.776 --> 31:42.016
This is the black tea base.

31:42.616 --> 31:43.616
Dianhong Black Tea.

31:44.376 --> 31:45.535
It has a strong taste.

31:45.536 --> 31:46.816
Is it cream?

31:47.376 --> 31:48.856
Only whole milk.

31:49.976 --> 31:53.815
Of course,
for those who are allergic to milk,

31:53.816 --> 31:56.256
we also developed
soy milk series.

31:58.336 --> 32:02.136
You can also add Chia
seeds and bubbles in it.

32:03.096 --> 32:06.535
Our bubble,
I plan to make it with konjak flour.

32:06.536 --> 32:09.295
Never add brown sugar and corn flour.

32:09.296 --> 32:13.255
So for people who are on a diet,
it's very friendly.

32:13.256 --> 32:14.376
Most importantly, it helps...

32:15.776 --> 32:16.776
relax the bowels.

32:17.616 --> 32:20.336
Then how to make bubbles with the Konjak?

32:21.016 --> 32:23.536
Using Konjak to make
bubbles is actually...

32:25.096 --> 32:26.855
Well, it's... it's a long story.

32:26.856 --> 32:29.135
Another day,
I'll teach you a lesson alone.

32:29.136 --> 32:30.735
Today, well.

32:30.736 --> 32:36.335
Please give us a score according to your taste.

32:36.336 --> 32:40.056
It's better to write down true feelings.

32:40.376 --> 32:42.056
Within fifty words.

32:43.256 --> 32:44.616
No need for more.

32:53.816 --> 32:55.255
Hello, Waitress.

32:55.256 --> 32:56.256
Coming.

33:00.736 --> 33:02.336
Mr. Ma, I'm going to work first.

33:02.616 --> 33:03.376
No, Nana.

33:03.376 --> 33:04.376
You write this...

33:17.136 --> 33:18.136
Tastes bad.

33:18.536 --> 33:19.816
Why?

33:20.256 --> 33:21.856
It's tasteless.

33:22.536 --> 33:23.536
Got it.

33:23.736 --> 33:24.816
You prefer strong flavors.

33:25.296 --> 33:26.296
Got it.

33:34.456 --> 33:35.576
Rinse your mouth first.

33:38.736 --> 33:39.535
What's up?

33:39.536 --> 33:40.575
This tastes too bad.

33:40.576 --> 33:41.855
Why is it so bitter?

33:41.856 --> 33:43.535
It's right to be bitter.

33:43.536 --> 33:44.615
You have to bear it.

33:44.616 --> 33:46.215
After that, the sweetness will come.

33:46.216 --> 33:47.295
Then it tastes sweet.

33:47.296 --> 33:48.536
This is the right moment to start...

33:49.256 --> 33:49.576
Alright.

33:49.577 --> 33:51.776
Rinse your mouth.

33:53.336 --> 33:56.656
Actually, bear it for a while,
and that sweetness...

33:58.696 --> 33:59.696
It's too bitter.

34:02.296 --> 34:04.815
Then how about the milk tea?

34:04.816 --> 34:06.375
These two are not sweet.

34:06.376 --> 34:08.016
Don't you have anything sweet here?

34:08.336 --> 34:09.576
Do you like sweetness?

34:10.816 --> 34:11.816
Got it.

34:13.696 --> 34:15.416
I take out my limited edition.

34:16.576 --> 34:18.136
I won't give it to common people.

34:22.576 --> 34:23.656
You like sweetness.

34:24.256 --> 34:26.016
I'll add the secret recipe for you.

34:27.536 --> 34:28.536
Sweet.

34:32.776 --> 34:33.712
Here.

34:33.736 --> 34:34.736
Try it.

34:35.216 --> 34:36.216
Please.

34:43.016 --> 34:44.016
Wait a minute.

34:44.736 --> 34:45.672
Qin.

34:45.696 --> 34:46.295
You...

34:46.296 --> 34:47.496
Drink it while hot.

34:47.976 --> 34:49.576
It tastes bad when it's cold.

34:51.776 --> 34:52.455
Come on.

34:52.456 --> 34:53.976
Add this to it.

34:54.856 --> 34:55.856
You...

34:56.016 --> 34:57.016
Come on.

34:58.056 --> 34:59.656
Alright.

35:01.736 --> 35:03.096
Add more.

35:06.296 --> 35:07.296
Enough?

35:07.536 --> 35:08.375
Add more.

35:08.376 --> 35:09.376
Don't.

35:09.976 --> 35:10.696
That's enough.

35:10.697 --> 35:11.855
Leave me some.

35:11.856 --> 35:13.615
It's... It's expensive.

35:13.616 --> 35:14.695
Let me add tea for you.

35:14.696 --> 35:15.776
No, this is not necessary.

35:22.296 --> 35:23.135
I tell you.

35:23.136 --> 35:24.775
This is what to sell.

35:24.776 --> 35:26.416
I'll give ten points for this.

35:28.896 --> 35:30.376
What about all these?

35:30.616 --> 35:33.295
Two points are the most.

35:33.296 --> 35:34.296
Two...

35:40.456 --> 35:41.536
Try this first.

35:46.336 --> 35:47.336
This is...

35:53.136 --> 35:54.135
Tastes good.

35:54.136 --> 35:55.495
This is delicious.

35:55.496 --> 35:58.256
The milk doesn't take away
all the taste of black tea.

35:58.816 --> 36:02.376
And this tea infusion tastes extremely soft.

36:03.296 --> 36:04.296
You understand it.

36:04.856 --> 36:07.215
This uses the third leaf,
the fourth leaf

36:07.216 --> 36:09.416
and the middle stem
to make tea shreds.

36:09.736 --> 36:12.136
Economical and sweet.

36:13.136 --> 36:14.256
Try milk green tea.

36:24.656 --> 36:25.656
You first...

36:32.016 --> 36:33.576
The taste of jasmine tea.

36:33.976 --> 36:35.576
The base is made of jasmine tea.

36:36.176 --> 36:38.376
Amazing! This is really amazing.

36:40.896 --> 36:42.335
What a fairy milk green tea!

36:42.336 --> 36:43.696
It tastes so good.

36:44.296 --> 36:45.696
It still needs to be improved.

36:46.216 --> 36:47.216
Tasty.

36:47.976 --> 36:49.096
Have you ever drunk soy milk?

36:49.416 --> 36:50.136
Let me tell you.

36:50.137 --> 36:52.135
Many people are lactose intolerant.

36:52.136 --> 36:53.975
So I developed the soy milk series.

36:53.976 --> 36:55.296
I'm fine. I can drink.

36:55.776 --> 36:57.576
You see, you know me.

36:59.936 --> 37:00.936
You first...

37:08.336 --> 37:09.336
Unique.

37:09.456 --> 37:10.856
It's so special.

37:11.216 --> 37:12.935
What a talent you are!

37:12.936 --> 37:15.375
You can match soy milk with Pu'er tea.

37:15.376 --> 37:16.776
Raw Pu'er tea.

37:17.256 --> 37:17.656
Good.

37:17.657 --> 37:18.935
It matches very well.

37:18.936 --> 37:19.936
Great.

37:20.616 --> 37:21.616
And this, right?

37:21.816 --> 37:22.816
This...

37:28.136 --> 37:29.655
Refreshing and sweet.

37:29.656 --> 37:30.656
What is this?

37:31.896 --> 37:33.096
This is...

37:34.096 --> 37:36.016
Water for mouth cleaning.

37:37.736 --> 37:39.895
Water. Water is a good thing.

37:39.896 --> 37:41.375
30% of tea and 70% of water.

37:41.376 --> 37:42.615
Drink water after tea.

37:42.616 --> 37:44.175
After drinking water,
drink this tea again.

37:44.176 --> 37:46.416
Mr. Ma,
let me try your pure tea.

37:48.656 --> 37:50.376
Do you want to try pure tea, too?

37:51.936 --> 37:52.936
Sure.

37:53.816 --> 37:54.816
Pure tea.

38:16.616 --> 38:17.616
Be careful, it's hot.

38:26.936 --> 38:28.936
The pure tea is really delicious.

38:29.176 --> 38:30.376
Let me try this.

38:32.696 --> 38:34.736
These two...

38:35.256 --> 38:36.256
are the same.

38:36.416 --> 38:37.935
The same.

38:37.936 --> 38:40.175
Do you have that scorecard?

38:40.176 --> 38:41.295
Let me give you a score.

38:41.296 --> 38:42.695
Yes, give a score.

38:42.696 --> 38:43.696
I got the card.

38:44.016 --> 38:44.495
Right.

38:44.496 --> 38:46.576
Here, give me a score.

38:51.256 --> 38:52.256
Scent.

38:56.736 --> 38:59.095
No, well, be objective.

38:59.096 --> 38:59.816
I'm objective.

38:59.817 --> 39:01.255
I'm very, very satisfied.

39:01.256 --> 39:02.256
Tastes good.

39:05.096 --> 39:06.575
You can also simply

39:06.576 --> 39:08.975
write some of your comments or suggestions.

39:08.976 --> 39:10.695
Are 800 words enough?

39:10.696 --> 39:11.696
Eight...

39:12.656 --> 39:13.455
Enough.

39:13.456 --> 39:14.456
Enough?

39:24.376 --> 39:25.376
How about it?

39:25.816 --> 39:26.975
Very good.

39:26.976 --> 39:27.976
What's the good point?

39:28.616 --> 39:30.136
I think it's all good.

39:32.296 --> 39:36.096
As a literal worker,
when you describe something,

39:36.416 --> 39:38.576
you... you need to be precise.

39:40.296 --> 39:41.936
I can write it down.

39:42.416 --> 39:45.536
But if you want me to say it,
I'm clumsy in speech.

39:45.936 --> 39:46.975
Well, then.

39:46.976 --> 39:49.496
Can I write a text and send it to you on WeChat?

39:51.136 --> 39:52.256
Do you have my WeChat?

39:57.016 --> 39:58.096
Do you have a WeChat account?

40:01.776 --> 40:02.776
Yeah.

40:02.816 --> 40:04.536
Can your mobile phone download WeChat?

40:05.776 --> 40:06.776
This one can't.

40:07.376 --> 40:08.376
It can't download.

40:16.256 --> 40:17.256
That one can.

40:17.416 --> 40:18.496
Come on.

40:18.816 --> 40:19.896
Add me.

40:21.816 --> 40:22.816
Here.

40:39.096 --> 40:40.256
[New message]

40:44.136 --> 40:46.135
[Dianhong bubble milk tea is like the wedding]

40:46.136 --> 40:48.615
[of the aroma of time fermentation
and the sweet taste of milk. ]

40:48.616 --> 40:50.535
[The sweetness dances
on the tip of the tongue, ]

40:50.536 --> 40:52.416
[stimulating the nerve to absorb happiness]

40:59.496 --> 41:01.295
[Osmanthus Oolong tea,
osmanthus and oolong are a natural pair]

41:01.296 --> 41:03.415
[They don't need any adornment.
Everything is just right ambiguous.]

41:03.416 --> 41:05.415
[It's like a rain of osmanthus in the mouth,
softening the heart.]

41:05.416 --> 41:06.895
[How generous and beautiful
the world's gift is! ]

41:06.896 --> 41:08.416
[We don't have any excuse not to love it.]

